In this Act—
"Employment and Labour Relations Court" means the Employment and Labour Relations Court established by the Employment and Labour Relations Court Act (Cap. 8E);
"Environment and Land Court" means the Environment and Land Court established by the Environment and Land Court Act (Cap. 8D);
"Judge" means the Chief Justice or any other judge appointed under Article 166 of the Constitution.
[Act No. 14 of 1977, Sch., Act No. 10A of 2012, s. 2, Act No. 18 of 2018, Sch.]
